    "B6_sample_questions": {
      "scene": "default",
      "description": "D-375, D-437: sample viewer questions for the cream after the main merge (142c1dd). Three questions about health, each asked by two or three viewers in the same words (the merged path groups only the same words, lower case and spacing aside), need a person's approval, so they wait on the host's list with a verified suggested reply from the product info: use around the eyes, redness-prone skin, broken skin; D-440: each one's answer is a sentence of the cream's sheet, since a reply the comments composer has to infer goes to the operator. The more askers, the higher they rank. One single question the product info does not answer (halal) goes to the operator.",
      "comments": [
        {
          "offset_ms": 0,
          "author_id": "u_mei",
          "author_name": "Mei",
          "text": "Can I use it around my eyes?",
          "expect": {
